# Design System (build standard)

Single source of truth for visual + layout decisions. Every color/font/spacing value must trace to a token here. If a value isn't defined, add it here first, then use it.

- CSS class prefix: `bdgsownv2-`, BEM-like (`block__element--modifier`). One canonical implementation per component; variants via modifiers, not copy-paste.
- Framework: Bootstrap 3.4.1 grid (`col-xs/sm/md/lg-*`). Not v4/v5. (Known constraint — Bootstrap 3 sets `html{font-size:10px}`; use px for fonts, see Typography.)
- Logo: `https://ik.imagekit.io/h1pfsvzlsf/bdgrowthsuite/images/logo.png`.

## Golden-standard principles (the craft bar)

Brand tokens (color/font/grid) mirror the homepage on purpose — internal consistency is itself a golden standard. These principles govern **craft** and match the discipline top product sites (Stripe, Linear, Vercel, Apple, Google, Cursor) share, within our locked brand. Every page is judged against this bar, not just "does it look like the homepage."

1. **One focal point, one primary action per view.** Size, weight, color, and space encode importance — not decoration.
2. **Whitespace is a feature.** Generous, consistent section rhythm (use `--section-y`). Don't fill space; use it.
3. **Spacing math.** Everything on the 4px grid; prefer 8px steps for layout. No magic numbers.
4. **Measure.** Body copy max ~68ch (`--content-measure`) for readability — never full-width paragraphs.
5. **Contrast + legibility.** WCAG AA minimum; muted text still ≥4.5:1.
6. **Restraint.** ≤2 accent colors per view; gradient for emphasis only; ≤2 font weights per block.
7. **Purposeful motion.** <300ms, ease-out, only to explain a change. No decorative loops. Respect reduced-motion.
8. **Every interactive element defines all states:** rest / hover / focus-visible / active / disabled (+ loading when async).
9. **Performance is design.** A beautiful page that loads slow fails — hit the Core Web Vitals budget below.
10. **Consistency over cleverness.** Reuse the canonical component; a new variant is a modifier, never a fork.

Rhythm tokens (put in every page `:root` alongside the type scale):

```css
:root{
  --section-y: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);  /* vertical padding per section */
  --content-measure: 68ch;              /* max body line length */
  --gutter: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);     /* page side padding */
}
```

